  'th.10': 'Cloud Ranch', 'th.11': 'Rainbow Fun Park', 'th.12': 'Penguin Iceberg', 'th.13': 'Desert Oasis', 'th.14': 'Toy Town',
  'th.15': 'Mysterious Library', 'th.16': 'Rainy Hydrangeas', 'th.17': 'Jungle Expedition', 'th.18': 'Bakery Street', 'th.19': 'Moon Rabbits',
  'thd.10': 'Nap with the cloud-sheep on fluffy cloud islands. A review of Medium techniques, now with fewer clues.',
  'thd.11': 'A park with a Ferris wheel and a carousel. Polish your Medium skills by mastering pointing and pairs.',
  'thd.12': 'Slide with the penguins on an iceberg under the aurora. From Medium to Hard, triples start to appear.',
  'thd.13': 'A desert oasis with swaying palm trees. The doorway to Hard, with some puzzles that need an X-Wing.',
  'thd.14': 'A toy train runs between block houses. Practice X-Wing, XY-Wing, triples and other Hard techniques.',
  'thd.15': 'A library where books float in the air. Tougher puzzles that combine several Hard techniques.',
  'thd.16': 'A rainy lane of hydrangeas. The doorway from Hard to Expert, where Swordfish and XYZ-Wing appear.',
  'thd.17': 'A jungle guided by a parrot and a monkey. Every Hard skill is needed, plus Expert ones like coloring.',
  'thd.18': 'A street that smells of croissants. Swordfish, XYZ-Wing, coloring and other expert skills are put to the test.',
  'thd.19': 'Rabbits pounding mochi on the moon. Even Jellyfish shows up in the collection’s grand finale.',
  'thl.10': 'Medium review, fewer clues', 'thl.11': 'Medium, mastery', 'thl.12': 'Medium to Hard', 'thl.13': 'first Hard puzzles', 'thl.14': 'Hard',
  'thl.15': 'tougher Hard', 'thl.16': 'Hard to Expert', 'thl.17': 'first Expert puzzles', 'thl.18': 'Expert', 'thl.19': 'Expert · grand finale',
  'ths.10': 'High above the clouds, across the rainbow bridge, lies a fluffy ranch. Every time the windmill turns, the cloud-sheep drop their numbers — gently guide them back into their 50 pens.',
  'ths.11': 'In the rainbow-colored fun park floating in the sky, numbers ride on balloons. Catch them one by one, before they float away.',
  'ths.12': 'An iceberg drifts under the aurora on the chilly northern sea. The penguins slipped on the ice and scattered the aurora’s colorful numbers everywhere.',
  'ths.13': 'Swaying on a camel’s back, you cross a sea of sand to a green oasis. Pick up the number stones sunk in its spring and build signposts for travelers.',
  'ths.14': 'Here is a little toy town that comes to life when you wind it up. Gather the train tickets the tin soldier dropped and get the toy train running again.',
  'ths.15': 'In this mysterious library, the books float up into the air at night. The wise old owl hoots that the book numbers are all mixed up — help put them back on the right shelves.',
  'ths.16': 'A soft rain is falling on the lane where hydrangeas bloom. The snail and the frog are counting the numbers on the raindrops — open your umbrella and lend a hand.',
  'ths.17': 'Birdsong echoes through a great green jungle. Follow the parrot’s calls to read the treasure map the monkey hid behind the waterfall.',
  'ths.18': 'From early morning, the smell of fresh bread fills Bakery Street. Give each of the 50 breads in the shop window its perfect price tag.',
  'ths.19': 'After visiting so many lands, it’s time to celebrate on top of the round full moon. Pound festive mochi with the moon rabbits, and bring a souvenir home to the forest bunnies.',
